node_modules/
package-lock.json
.tmp/
# The working plan is tracked; everything else under .plans/ is not — .plans/memory/
# is a mirror of Claude's auto-memory and is personal notes, not project material.
# Written as `.plans/*` rather than `.plans/`, because git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is itself excluded.
.plans/*
!.plans/propagate-tags-and-performers.md
# `.claude/` holds two different things: the Stop hooks, which are project policy
# and belong to anyone who clones this, and `settings.local.json`, which is this
# machine's. Written as `.claude/*` for the same reason `.plans/*` is - git cannot
# re-include a path whose parent directory is itself excluded.
.claude/*
!.claude/hooks/
